<title>SWEDEN: Volvo Trucks deliveries fall 15 pct Jan/F.</title>
<headline>Volvo Trucks deliveries fall 15 pct Jan/F.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Volvo Trucks, a unit of Swedish automotive group AB Volvo, said on Monday its deliveries fell 15 percent in the first two months of the year to 9,487 from 11,104 in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>In Europe, Volvo Trucks' largest market, deliveries fell 27 percent to 4,830 trucks, and in South America slipped by seven percent.</p>
<p>But in North America, its second largest market, deliveries rose by seven percent to 3,077.</p>
<p>Deliveries rose seven percent on so called 'other markets'.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1011</p>
</text>
